OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'lovely' school
OL,4,Acaretaker
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a primary
OL,7,Fschool caretaker and football coach who
OL,8,Fdied on Tuesday.
OL,10,FFlowers have been left outside Stoke
OL,11,FPrimary School in Coventry for
OL,12,Fcaretaker John Halford, who one parent
OL,13,Fsaid was "so caring, looked out for
OL,14,Feverybody and will be so missed".
OL,16,FAnother parent told the BBC her
OL,17,Fdaughter and son "loved him", adding
OL,18,F"he was a lovely man and was outside
OL,19,Fthe school every morning to greet
OL,20,Feveryone".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
