OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'lovely' school
OL,4,Acaretaker
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Ascroft, headteacher, said in a
OL,7,Fstatement: "John was a valued member of
OL,8,Four community and we are working our
OL,9,Fway forwards."
